# request: "Layer diagram of our data platform for the onboarding doc, top to
#  bottom: apps (the Slack support bot, the Salesforce sales copilot, Looker
#  dashboards); ML and AI (the LiteLLM gateway, pgvector vectors, Feast
#  features, MLflow models); data (Fivetran ingestion, dbt transforms, the
#  Snowflake warehouse, Airflow scheduling); infrastructure (AWS, EKS,
#  Terraform). Security and monitoring cut across all layers. Highlight the
#  LLM gateway."
